{"id": "unknown-2026-05-27-004", "date": "2026-05-27", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 5, "week": 22, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["expand"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Russia clears Indonesia–EAEU FTA for implementation to expand trade", "content": "Russian President Vladimir Putin recently signed a law that ratifies an FTA between the Eurasian Economic Union and Indonesia. \nThe FTA ensures preferential terms for nearly 90 per cent of commodities and grants the most favoured regime status for goods from both sides with exceptions. \nAgricultural and manufactured goods from Indonesia will gain wider market access, boosting regional supply chains. ", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/russia-clears-indonesia-eaeu-fta-for-implementation-to-expand-trade-310577-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
